1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 19]</font>

15
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

16
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

17
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you leave so suddenly yesterday?</font>

18
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You put my brother in a terrible spot.</font>

19
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

20
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand your brother's intentions.</font>

21
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:32,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I didn't mean it that way.</font>

22
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:33,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you understand what I mean?</font>

23
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:35,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

24
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's with all this meaning and that?</font>

25
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

26
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:41,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan mistook my father for you</font>

27
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:43,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and confessed his love like crazy.</font>

28
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My father thought he was ill,</font>

29
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so he locked him up</font>

30
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and punished him to copy
our ancestral teachings 1,000 times.</font>

31
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's 1,000 times.</font>

32
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:55,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget it. Let's not talk about this.</font>

33
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:57,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you say you wanted me
to go shopping with you?</font>

34
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

35
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just so you know.</font>

36
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The clothes I chose this time
are a bit special.</font>

37
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me pick them out carefully.</font>

38
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No problem.</font>

39
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I guarantee you'll stun everyone.</font>

40
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who told you to dress like this?</font>

41
00:02:58,200 --> 00:02:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying said it looks good.</font>

42
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What could you possibly dislike?</font>

43
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That Jiang Ying...</font>

44
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:05,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

45
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe you should skip Nightfall Haven.</font>

46
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just keep thinking</font>

47
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:15,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that once others see you</font>

48
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like this,</font>

49
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't be able to help myself</font>

50
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but to gouge their eyes out.</font>

51
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:22,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When that happens,</font>

52
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll stick very close</font>

53
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to your side.</font>

54
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If anyone dares to glance at me,</font>

55
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:27,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll glare right back at them.</font>

56
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

57
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, right.</font>

58
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:31,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

59
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:33,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once we enter Nightfall Haven,</font>

60
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you mustn't say Your Highness anymore.</font>

61
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just call me what you used to.</font>

62
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Congyao.</font>

63
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's nothing here</font>

64
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:13,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but water.</font>

65
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is Nightfall Haven?</font>

66
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here it comes.</font>

67
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:28,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

68
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nightfall Haven</font>

69
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a hidden pavilion on a lonely island.</font>

70
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The mastermind behind this
is truly brilliant</font>

71
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to have found such a wondrous place</font>

72
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and concealed Nightfall Haven here.</font>

73
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The lake is shrouded in mist.</font>

74
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Without a guide to lead the way,</font>

75
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">once you enter,</font>

76
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll surely lose your bearings.</font>

77
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hand over your token
before you board the boat.</font>

78
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is hers?</font>

79
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's my companion.</font>

80
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She enters with me.</font>

81
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:26,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch out.</font>

82
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Place your bets, high or low.</font>

83
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No more bets.</font>

84
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- High!
- Reveal!</font>

85
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:53,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">High!</font>

86
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:53,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's high!</font>

87
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, come on!</font>

88
00:05:59,320 --> 00:06:00,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This way, please.</font>

89
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:00,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, come!</font>

90
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:09,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

91
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:16,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is your private booth.</font>

92
00:06:17,080 --> 00:06:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please do not enter other booths.</font>

93
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If anything were to happen,</font>

94
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could not bear the responsibility.</font>

95
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you have decided what you desire,</font>

96
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you may call for me again.</font>

97
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:28,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may leave.</font>

98
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:44,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Price List]</font>

99
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

100
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at Nightfall Haven,
anything can be traded,</font>

101
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">including me.</font>

102
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you.</font>

103
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before the tigress beside me
bares her claws,</font>

104
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:28,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd best get lost now.</font>

105
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:30,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take my leave.</font>

106
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear,</font>

107
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a woman threw herself at me,</font>

108
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you just coldly watched
from the side?</font>

109
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't seem to be dodging either.</font>

110
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

111
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">meddling in others' affairs
brings retribution.</font>

112
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if you also fancy her?</font>

113
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:52,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should mind my own business.</font>

114
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:56,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This room</font>

115
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">reeks of jealousy.</font>

116
00:07:58,320 --> 00:07:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Shadow Master is here.</font>

117
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go</font>

118
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and take a look.</font>

119
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:14,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, Shadow Master.</font>

120
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rise.</font>

121
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Shadow Master</font>

122
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">certainly puts on a grand show.</font>

123
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That figure</font>

124
00:08:26,960 --> 00:08:28,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">seems strangely familiar.</font>

125
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems you've met</font>

126
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">many men over the years.</font>

127
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I grew up surrounded by men.</font>

128
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've seen every type there is.</font>

129
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Shadow Master has appeared</font>

130
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to bring you good news.</font>

131
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're having the Moon Banquet.</font>

132
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In ten days, the Shadow Master will</font>

133
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">host a grand celebration here.</font>

134
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On that occasion,</font>

135
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we will present a treasure</font>

136
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">never before seen in this world.</font>

137
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:54,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whoever claims this prize</font>

138
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will find their future</font>

139
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:57,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bright with promise.</font>

140
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And this black token</font>

141
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:01,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the entry pass for the Moon Banquet.</font>

142
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How does one get a black token?</font>

143
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just spend as much</font>

144
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as ten thousand liang of silver.</font>

145
00:09:09,160 --> 00:09:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To ensure exclusivity,</font>

146
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">black tokens are limited.</font>

147
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ten thousand liang is nothing.</font>

148
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Reserve one for me.</font>

149
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:14,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open the market.</font>

150
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The black token is a gimmick.</font>

151
00:09:19,400 --> 00:09:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think</font>

152
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they have some ulterior motive</font>

153
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for hosting this Moon Banquet?</font>

154
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:26,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

155
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll find a way
to tail the Shadow Master.</font>

156
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Head back to the room first.</font>

157
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful.</font>

158
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be long.</font>

159
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

160
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what brings you here?</font>

161
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:55,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Moon Banquet is just days away.</font>

162
00:09:57,040 --> 00:09:58,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I find myself</font>

163
00:09:58,560 --> 00:09:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">truly ill at ease.</font>

164
00:10:02,520 --> 00:10:03,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai,</font>

165
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you believe this plan</font>

166
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will actually work?</font>

167
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest assured.</font>

168
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:10,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyone who can spend a fortune</font>

169
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:11,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to secure a black token</font>

170
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must be a regular at Nightfall Haven.</font>

171
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They are the elite among the elite.</font>

172
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With the support of such people,</font>

173
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your grand ambitions</font>

174
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:19,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will certainly be within reach.</font>

175
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai, you truly are
my greatest reassurance.</font>

176
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing can go wrong
at the Moon Banquet.</font>

177
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you handle this matter well,</font>

178
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am willing to make a small sacrifice.</font>

179
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai,</font>

180
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:53,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what is the matter?</font>

181
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:55,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nothing.</font>

182
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just forgot</font>

183
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to arrange some matters</font>

184
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">concerning the Moon Banquet.</font>

185
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Excuse me, this is your treasure.</font>

186
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wish you peace and health.</font>

187
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I present the treasure to you.</font>

188
00:11:35,640 --> 00:11:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not now.</font>

189
00:11:36,760 --> 00:11:38,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm busy here.</font>

190
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come back later.</font>

191
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You scared me to death.</font>

192
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei, what were you doing?</font>

193
00:11:59,680 --> 00:12:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

194
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's your fault.</font>

195
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You came back so late.</font>

196
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did it go?</font>

197
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's exactly as we suspected.</font>

198
00:12:08,280 --> 00:12:09,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle is the true master
of Nightfall Haven.</font>

199
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Shadow Master</font>

200
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is nothing but a puppet.</font>

201
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:14,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle</font>

202
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">truly dares to touch anything.</font>

203
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle is the master of Nightfall Haven</font>

204
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and went to such lengths
for the Moon Banquet.</font>

205
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She must have an ulterior motive.</font>

206
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Excuse me.</font>

207
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you finished your business?</font>

208
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, you were just...</font>

209
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enter.</font>

210
00:12:58,480 --> 00:12:59,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here is the treasure you requested.</font>

211
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:01,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear, you've worked hard.</font>

212
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:03,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there anything you desire?</font>

213
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you wish to reward me,</font>

214
00:13:05,880 --> 00:13:07,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bring out all the finest things.</font>

215
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:09,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

216
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

217
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:15,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your requested items are all prepared.</font>

218
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, verify them.</font>

219
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:18,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could the Prince be a corrupt official?</font>

220
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's quite a fortune.</font>

221
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- So much money.
- Master.</font>

222
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That man spent lavishly.</font>

223
00:13:32,680 --> 00:13:34,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was the first to get
a black token tonight.</font>

224
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go do something for me.</font>

225
00:13:45,440 --> 00:13:45,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Excuse me.</font>

226
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:47,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enter.</font>

227
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

228
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:53,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Shadow Master wishes to see you.</font>

229
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be back shortly.</font>

230
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This way, please.</font>

231
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:24,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, come in.</font>

232
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:33,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is your Shadow Master?</font>

233
00:14:35,760 --> 00:14:36,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's occupied.</font>

234
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Allow me to attend to you first.</font>

235
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It wasn't the Shadow Master
who sent for me, was it?</font>

236
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:43,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seeing your distinguished bearing,</font>

237
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fell in love with you</font>

238
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at first sight.</font>

239
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:49,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not</font>

240
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:51,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let me</font>

241
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">first serve you some tea?</font>

242
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:56,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go.</font>

243
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:01,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll drink this tea</font>

244
00:15:02,160 --> 00:15:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on his behalf.</font>

245
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're dressed so plainly.</font>

246
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why seduce my husband</font>

247
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in secret?</font>

248
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have a fierce wife.</font>

249
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd best beg for mercy.</font>

250
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is my fault.</font>

251
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I deserve death.</font>

252
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please forgive me.</font>

253
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should count yourself lucky</font>

254
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:24,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that this is Nightfall Haven.</font>

255
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honey.</font>

256
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:27,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

257
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

258
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I deserve death.</font>

259
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That woman drank</font>

260
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:42,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that cup of tea.</font>

261
00:15:43,760 --> 00:15:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

262
00:15:45,160 --> 00:15:46,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since she is his wife,</font>

263
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:48,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he can't just leave her to die.</font>

264
00:15:50,520 --> 00:15:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

265
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why did you follow me?</font>

266
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I hadn't followed you,</font>

267
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd be in her tender embrace by now.</font>

268
00:15:59,400 --> 00:15:59,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

269
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why is your face so red?</font>

270
00:16:04,040 --> 00:16:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your face is the one that's red!</font>

271
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:08,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm being serious.</font>

272
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:13,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So cool.</font>

273
00:16:13,680 --> 00:16:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So soothing.</font>

274
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:15,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

275
00:16:16,520 --> 00:16:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you alright?</font>

276
00:16:17,960 --> 00:16:19,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have I caught a cold?</font>

277
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:22,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do I feel so dizzy?</font>

278
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Darn it.</font>

279
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The tea was poisoned.</font>

280
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:28,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come inside with me first.</font>

281
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:38,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

282
00:16:38,160 --> 00:16:38,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you alright?</font>

283
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:40,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me get you some water.</font>

284
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So hot.</font>

285
00:16:46,040 --> 00:16:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So hot.</font>

286
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:48,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're burning up.</font>

287
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:04,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

288
00:17:08,860 --> 00:17:10,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

289
00:17:11,730 --> 00:17:13,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

290
00:17:13,390 --> 00:17:16,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

291
00:17:17,320 --> 00:17:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

292
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:25,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

293
00:17:25,980 --> 00:17:30,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

294
00:17:30,510 --> 00:17:34,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

295
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

296
00:17:42,970 --> 00:17:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

297
00:17:47,650 --> 00:17:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

298
00:17:51,690 --> 00:17:56,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

299
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:59,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

300
00:18:00,220 --> 00:18:04,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

301
00:18:04,820 --> 00:18:08,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
